		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Whip-thin, razor-scaled blue- grey drake. Horse-sized.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +3 (2d6) or 1 accursed gout, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Accursed Gout</strong>. Gout black blast within double near. All creatures in a near-sized cube around where the blast lands, CHA 12+ or cursed, DISADV on checks for 1d4 rounds. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Corruption</strong>. If drake kills a creature afflicted by accursed gout, the victim rises as a wight in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
